      "start_seconds": 1.06,
      "end_seconds": 5.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Oh, morning, doctor. Lovely to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.16,
      "end_seconds": 13.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.56,
      "end_seconds": 23.96,
      "duration_seconds": 9.4,
      "text": "it's a red hot swelling on my leg i thought I'd wait you know but it hasn't gone"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.63,
      "end_seconds": 25.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.92,
      "end_seconds": 29.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "About... well, about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.04,
      "end_seconds": 40.05,
      "duration_seconds": 9.01,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets how often and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.69,
      "end_seconds": 55.25,
      "duration_seconds": 13.56,
      "text": "right about a eight out of ten honestly once or twice a day there was pain much worse than it looks yes but that went away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.92,
      "end_seconds": 67.97,
      "duration_seconds": 8.05,
      "text": "Have you had a red hot swelling on your leg before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.94,
      "end_seconds": 75.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "a bit, last winter it settled by itself back then"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.03,
      "end_seconds": 79.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "did you get cut or insect bite?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.75,
      "end_seconds": 83.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "No, no cut or insect bite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.32,
      "end_seconds": 86.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.48,
      "end_seconds": 90.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.77,
      "end_seconds": 94.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.33,
      "end_seconds": 104.68,
      "duration_seconds": 8.35,
      "text": "Diabetes, for about a year. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.68,
      "end_seconds": 109.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Right, what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.84,
      "end_seconds": 124.22,
      "duration_seconds": 9.38,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, I'm on sitagliptin, 100 milligrams, once a day for my sugar"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.66,
      "end_seconds": 135.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "alright, how about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.24,
      "end_seconds": 140.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.47,
      "end_seconds": 142.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.23,
      "end_seconds": 148.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.34,
      "end_seconds": 152.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.14,
      "end_seconds": 160.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.07,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.57,
      "end_seconds": 162.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "what's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.56,
      "end_seconds": 169.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.26,
      "end_seconds": 190.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.49,
      "end_seconds": 197.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "yes tramadol it gives me feeling very drowsy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.36,
      "end_seconds": 201.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.04,
      "end_seconds": 210.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.13,
      "end_seconds": 240.85,
      "duration_seconds": 12.72,
      "text": "okay: temperature is 39.2 degrees, height 174 centimetres, heart rate 99, saturation 98 percent, BMI works out to to 22.5, weight 68 kilos, pressure 124 over 75."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.83,
      "end_seconds": 243.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.77,
      "end_seconds": 253.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.09,
      "end_seconds": 258.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.02,
      "end_seconds": 272.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "Okay doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.11,
      "end_seconds": 274.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.04,
      "end_seconds": 295.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.85,
      "text": "the skin on your leg is dusky with blisters and is very tender, and you are feverish"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.74,
      "end_seconds": 330.6,
      "duration_seconds": 31.86,
      "text": "okay, that's enough for me. So where does that leave us? The most likely explanation is a severe deep skin infection needing urgent surgery review. Let's get an urgent surgical review, for possible necrotising infection. I am sending you to hospital now, do not wait. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. I think the surgical team should see you too"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.63,
      "end_seconds": 333.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "alright, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.71,
      "end_seconds": 339.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "we'll catch up straight away anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.06,
      "end_seconds": 345.53,
